        "Apple MDM exchanges \u2014 https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/sending-mdm-commands-to-a-device",
        "Native webhook contract \u2014 https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/main/docs/operations/webhooks.md"
      ]
    },
